WEBVTT

00:00:04.479 --> 00:00:06.872
But, Daddy...

00:00:06.916 --> 00:00:10.093
I never got to eat a Troll.

00:00:10.136 --> 00:00:12.922
What's gonna
make me happy now?

00:00:16.142 --> 00:00:17.143
Come here, son.

00:00:19.798 --> 00:00:21.104
Nothing.

00:00:21.147 --> 00:00:24.324
Absolutely nothing.

00:00:24.368 --> 00:00:28.677
You will never, ever, ever,
ever be happy.

00:00:29.504 --> 00:00:30.505
Never?

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:32.376
Ever.

00:00:40.776 --> 00:00:41.777
[BRIDGET SIGHS]

00:00:44.693 --> 00:00:47.609
Here! Right here!

00:00:47.652 --> 00:00:51.569
This is where we will
rebuild our civilization.

00:00:51.613 --> 00:00:52.788
[ALL CHEERING]

00:00:52.831 --> 00:00:55.617
It has everything we need.

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:58.315
Fresh air,
clean water...

00:00:58.358 --> 00:01:00.796
and sweet acoustics.

00:01:00.839 --> 00:01:02.145
[ECHOING]

00:01:02.188 --> 00:01:03.973
[BANGING RHYTHMICALLY][ALL CHEERING]

00:01:07.063 --> 00:01:10.632
♪ Ba de ya
Say do you remember

00:01:10.675 --> 00:01:14.505
♪ Ba de ya
Dancing in September

00:01:14.549 --> 00:01:18.901
♪ Ba de ya
Never was a cloudy day ♪

00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:25.603
POPPY: Twenty years ago today,
King Peppy made us safe...

00:01:25.647 --> 00:01:26.865
and now every Troll is free

00:01:26.909 --> 00:01:28.824
to be happy
and live in perfect...

00:01:28.867 --> 00:01:30.695
♪ Harmony ♪ Harmony

00:01:30.739 --> 00:01:32.175
♪ Harmony

00:01:32.218 --> 00:01:34.438
And that's why
we hug every hour.

00:01:34.482 --> 00:01:35.526
Yep.

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:37.485
I wish it was
every half hour.

00:01:37.528 --> 00:01:38.616
So do I.

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:39.704
But that wouldn't leave
much time

00:01:39.748 --> 00:01:41.358
for singing and dancing,
now would it?

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:44.666
Princess Poppy,
do the Bergens
still want to eat us?

00:01:44.709 --> 00:01:46.537
You bet![ALL GASP]

00:01:46.581 --> 00:01:49.409
But just because
it's the only way
they'll ever be happy.

00:01:49.453 --> 00:01:52.500
[SLURPS] Oh, no.
I do taste delicious.

00:01:52.543 --> 00:01:55.677
Isn't there anything else
to make them happy?

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:57.635
Ooh. What about
having birthday parties?

00:01:57.679 --> 00:01:59.158
Or slumber parties?

00:01:59.202 --> 00:02:02.379
Or staring at your parents
while they sleep.

00:02:02.422 --> 00:02:03.467
[ALL GROANING]

00:02:03.511 --> 00:02:05.208
But I don't want
to be food.

00:02:05.251 --> 00:02:08.167
Don't worry.
No Troll ever will be.

00:02:08.211 --> 00:02:09.734
And that's why
we're celebrating

00:02:09.778 --> 00:02:11.867
with the biggest party ever.

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:14.043
Everybody's gonna be there.

00:02:14.086 --> 00:02:16.219
Everybody?

00:02:16.262 --> 00:02:17.829
Everybody.

00:02:17.873 --> 00:02:20.049
